# ============================================================================
# BOMLLM — Ollama Modelfile (SANITIZED EXAMPLE)
# Build:   ollama create qwen38-chat -f configs/ollama-modelfile.example
# Verify:  ollama show qwen38-chat --modelfile
#
# Design notes:
#  * ONE manifest per model, shared by all aliases (ollama cp for aliases).
#    [PROD LESSON] MLX reloads ~1.2s when switching aliases whose manifests
#    DIFFER; identical manifests switch free. So: floor here, behavior on
#    the LiteLLM route.
#  * Weights are NOT redistributed. Pull the base from the original
#    author's Hugging Face repo and point FROM at your local tag.
#  * The SYSTEM floor below is a PLACEHOLDER persona. The validated Thai
#    system prompt (Config G) ships in configs/sampling-recipe.yaml —
#    apply it per-route, not baked in, so raw callers and WebUI users can
#    each get the right persona.
# ============================================================================

# Base weights: a 27B-class Qwen fine-tune (TURBO-Fable series by DavidAU),
# MLX nvfp4 quant. Replace with the tag YOU pulled.
#   Example: ollama pull hf.co/<author>/<repo>:<tag>   then FROM that tag.
FROM turbo-fable-nvfp4   # CHANGE_ME — your local tag for the 27B MLX weights

# Context floor for every alias.
# [PROD LESSON] post-swap we lost the Modelfile floor and raw callers
# silently dropped to num_ctx 8192. Set it here; routes can raise it.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# Keep sampling minimal here — route-level params in litellm.yaml win
# per-request and are easier to A/B. These are only safe defaults for
# raw callers that bypass the proxy.
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05

# Minimal safety floor persona (REPLACE with your own; the full validated
# Thai recipe with few-shots is in configs/sampling-recipe.yaml).
SYSTEM """
You are a helpful assistant. Answer in the language of the user's most
recent message unless instructed otherwise. Never emit Chinese characters
unless the user asks about Chinese. Be concise; admit uncertainty.
"""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Alias pattern (free switching on MLX — identical manifests):
#   ollama create qwen38-chat -f thisfile
#   ollama cp qwen38-chat qwen38-think
#   ollama cp qwen38-chat qwen38-code
#   ollama cp qwen38-chat qwen38-deep
#   ollama cp qwen38-chat qwen38-fast
# Then differentiate behavior in litellm.yaml routes (temperature,
# num_predict, think on/off) — NOT in separate Modelfiles.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
